Merge origin/modular-editors: spans stage 6 (DefStatics by delta), ported onto Modules II

The branch-neutral parts (sums, step_chain, deltas, nest_map, co_union,
head_equal, calc_chain) as on modular-editors. calc_module_item's
interface part rebuilt on Modules II:
- lower_members lowers members against the signature (item_ana_labels),
  reusing a member's wrapper while it and its expectations are the same;
  the tail is lower_tail by export names;
- the module type is module_sig_type, the old object kept while equal;
- a signature the members don't meet still analyzes the item whole;
- the module value is refold_module_elab, and there is no M.T alias.
Kept: the library ctx_in, ttransit's dirty values, ctor deltas.
Edits in mega-mod-1k wrapped or sealed in a module: ~100 → 7ms.

